  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Dong Fang Yu Liang names Dong Fang tribe’s three-person combination killer move three hearts combination soul, and those present treat it as a move the world already knows.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The move lets three Gu Masters’ souls fuse temporarily so they work as one in defense, attack, or retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        507
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Fang Yuan’s wolf army, Jiang Wan Shan, Wan Xin, and E Xuan Ming activate the move together. The listed Gu include rank three djinn heart Gu, rank two Heart Sound Gu, rank two harmony Gu, rank three Flying Soul Gu, rank three Soul Chain Gu, and rank four Soul Combination Gu. Their souls leave their bodies and merge; within two hundred li, Gu Masters with at least five hundred man soul feel pressure, and Fang Yuan reads the fused soul as about one thousand four hundred man soul. Under the fusion they speak and act in sync, share thoughts at once, and command crab, crocodile, and bladewing blood bat groups as one mixed force that Fang Yuan says would scatter if the killer move broke. Leaving the state needs at least two to three minutes.",
      "chapters": [
        511
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_jiang_wan_shan",
        "char_wan_xin",
        "char_e_xuan_ming",
        "gu_djinn_heart_gu",
        "gu_heart_sound_gu",
        "gu_harmony_gu",
        "gu_flying_soul_gu",
        "gu_soul_chain_gu",
        "gu_soul_combination_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan attempts to refine Nauseous Crying Baby Gu mainly to deal with three hearts combination soul, but even with near refinement-master skill his attempts fail. In his prior life, Ma Hong Yun and Sheng Ling Er create that Gu after Dong Fang Qing Yu reveals the move’s secrets, and repeated losses lead Dong Fang tribe to phase the killer move out; during the battle of the five regions it is stolen, improved, and finally left behind in history once counters spread.",
      "chapters": [
        507
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
